==Albanian==

===Etymology===
Probably a short form of {{der|sq|ine-pro|*bʰrā́ter||brother}}. Compare {{cog|xil|*bra}}, {{cog|cu|братъ}}, {{cog|prg|brāti}}, {{cog|non|bróðir}}, {{cog|sga|bráthair}}, {{cog|sa|भ्रातृ|tr=bhrā́tṛ}} and {{cog|ku|bra}}, all meaning “brother”.

===Interjection===
{{head|sq|interjection}}

# A friendly [[exclamation]] to a [[person]].
#: Folni '''''bre''', burra!
#:: Speak, '''''therefore''', men!
# An [[exclamation]] of [[surprise]].
#: '''''Bre'''! Po ç'është kjo?
#:: '''''Man'''! What is this?

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|sq|brez}}
* {{l|sq|pra}}

